":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":9,"sd":null},{"k":"37:10","t":"Except one who snatches [some words] by theft, but they are pursued by a burning flame, piercing [in brightness].","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":10,"sd":null},{"k":"37:11","t":"Then inquire of them, [O Muḥammad], \"Are they a stronger [or more difficult] creation or those [others] We have created?\" Indeed, We created them [i.e., men] from sticky clay.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":11,"sd":null},{"k":"37:12","t":"But you wonder, while they mock,","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":12,"sd":null},{"k":"37:13","t":"And when they are reminded, they remember not.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"37:14","t":"And when they see a sign, they ridicule.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"37:15","t":"And say, \"This is not but obvious magic.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"37:16","t":"When we have died and become dust and bones, are we indeed to be resurrected?","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"37:17","t":"And our forefathers [as well]?\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"37:18","t":"Say, \"Yes, and you will be [rendered] contemptible.\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"37:19","t":"It will be only one shout, and at once they will be observing.","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"37:20","t":"They will say, \"O woe to us! This is the Day of Recompense.\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"37:21","t":"[They will be told], \"This is the Day of Judgement which you used to deny.\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"37:22","t":"[The angels will be ordered], \"Gather those who committed wrong, their kinds, and what they used to worship","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"37:23","t":"Other than Allāh, and guide them to the path of Hellfire","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"37:24","t":"And stop them; indeed, they are to be questioned.\"","j":23,"h":45,"s":37,"a":24,"sd":null}],"juz":23,"hizb":45,"surahs":[37],"sajdah":false}